It's actually not that bad that I lost Mojo, it would have weighed too
much to take with me anyway.  chucked the =oTC for a +2 ring of
increased damage.  There will be no return...  still climb? y.

Took out Rodney easily, and the other pests.  Booze/gold'ed the first
portal, wand-dug straight there, next!  Plane of Air: confused-gold'd
the portal, worked my way over there.  I got pummeled with debris a few
times, but mostly this was easy.  Plane of Water was mysteriously
empty.  I suspect my first genocide inadvertently made this level
pretty boring.  Orb'd the portal twice... I don't understand the
bubbles.  Was I supposed to be underwater?  I dunno, but I got to the
portal.  Plane of Fire: orbed the portal, levitated over there.  No
problemo.

Made it to the Astral plane!  Ooh-Aah!

OK, ESP says I got Death on the left, Pestilence in the center, and
