Only one altar left.  I mosh through to it.  Manage to dance around the
riders this time, using bugs for buffers, but Death is there AGAIN.
Like Paris Hilton, he just won't go away.  I kill him again, swim on
into the altar room I know is the right one. Ahhh.... invisible
choir....




